h2 Starters
text Functional examples of using Bootstrap in common JS frameworks like Webpack, Parcel, Vite, and more you can edit in StackBlitz.
row
  row
    col
      h3 CDN starter
      text Instantly include Bootstrap's compiled CSS and JavaScript via the jsDelivr CDN.
      link "https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/starter?file=index.html" https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/starter?file=index.html
  row
    col
      h3 Sass & JS
      text Use npm to import and compile Bootstrap's Sass with Autoprefixer and Stylelint, plus our bundled JavaScript.
      link "https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/sass-js?file=index.html" https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/sass-js?file=index.html
  row
    col
      h3 Sass & ESM JS
      text Import and compile Bootstrap's Sass with Autoprefixer and Stylelint, and compile our source JavaScript with an ESM shim.
      link "https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/sass-js-esm?file=index.html" https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/sass-js-esm?file=index.html
  row
    col
      h3 Bootstrap color modes
      text Import and compile Bootstrap's Sass with Stylelint, and the Bootstrap color modes.
      link "https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/color-modes?file=index.html" https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/color-modes?file=index.html
  row
    col
      h3 Bootstrap Icons
      text Import and compile Bootstrap's Sass with Stylelint, PurgeCSS, and the Bootstrap Icons web font.
      link "https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/icons-font?file=index.html" https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/icons-font?file=index.html
  row
    col
      h3 Parcel
      text Import and bundle Bootstrap's source Sass and JavaScript via Parcel.
      link "https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/parcel?file=src/index.html" https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/parcel?file=src/index.html
  row
    col
      h3 React
      text Import and bundle Bootstrap's source Sass and JavaScript with React, Next.js, and React Bootstrap.
      link "https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/react-nextjs?file=src/pages/index.tsx" https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/react-nextjs?file=src/pages/index.tsx
  row
    col
      h3 Vite
      text Import and bundle Bootstrap's source Sass and JavaScript with Vite.
      link "https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/vite?file=index.html" https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/vite?file=index.html
  row
    col
      h3 Vue
      text Import and bundle Bootstrap's source Sass and JavaScript with Vue and Vite.
      link "https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/vue?file=index.html" https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/vue?file=index.html
  row
    col
      h3 Webpack
      text Import and bundle Bootstrap's source Sass and JavaScript with Webpack.
      link "https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/webpack?file=src/index.html" https://stackblitz.com/github/twbs/examples/tree/main/webpack?file=src/index.html
h2 Snippets
text Common patterns for building sites and apps that build on existing components and utilities with custom CSS and more.
row
  col
    link Headers /docs/5.3/examples/headers/
    text Display your branding, navigation, search, and more with these header components
  col
    link Heroes /docs/5.3/examples/heroes/
    text Set the stage on your homepage with heroes that feature clear calls to action.
  col
    link Features /docs/5.3/examples/features/
    text Explain the features, benefits, or other details in your marketing content.
  col
    link Sidebars /docs/5.3/examples/sidebars/
    text Common navigation patterns ideal for offcanvas or multi-column layouts.
  col
    link Footers /docs/5.3/examples/footers/
    text Finish every page strong with an awesome footer, big or small.
  col
    link Dropdowns /docs/5.3/examples/dropdowns/
    text Enhance your dropdowns with filters, icons, custom styles, and more.
  col
    link "List groups" /docs/5.3/examples/list-groups/
    text Extend list groups with utilities and custom styles for any content.
  col
    link Modals /docs/5.3/examples/modals/
    text Transform modals to serve any purpose, from feature tours to dialogs.
  col
    link Badges /docs/5.3/examples/badges/
    text Make badges work with custom inner HTML and new looks.
  col
    link Breadcrumbs /docs/5.3/examples/breadcrumbs/
    text Integrate custom icons and create stepper components.
  col
    link Buttons /docs/5.3/examples/buttons/
    text Create custom buttons for just about any use case with utilities.
  col
    link Jumbotrons /docs/5.3/examples/jumbotrons/
    text Create modernized versions of the classic Bootstrap component.
h2 Custom Components
text Brand-new components and templates to help folks quickly get started with Bootstrap and demonstrate best practices for adding onto the framework.
row
  col
    link Album /docs/5.3/examples/album/
    text Simple one-page template for photo galleries, portfolios, and more.
  col
    link Pricing /docs/5.3/examples/pricing/
    text Example pricing page built with Cards and featuring a custom header and footer.
  col
    link Checkout /docs/5.3/examples/checkout/
    text Custom checkout form showing our form components and their validation features.
  col
    link Product /docs/5.3/examples/product/
    text Lean product-focused marketing page with extensive grid and image work.
  col
    link Cover /docs/5.3/examples/cover/
    text A one-page template for building simple and beautiful home pages.
  col
    link Carousel /docs/5.3/examples/carousel/
    text Customize the navbar and carousel, then add some new components.
  col
    link Blog /docs/5.3/examples/blog/
    text Magazine like blog template with header, navigation, featured content.
  col
    link Dashboard /docs/5.3/examples/dashboard/
    text Basic admin dashboard shell with fixed sidebar and navbar.
  col
    link Sign-in /docs/5.3/examples/sign-in/
    text Custom form layout and design for a simple sign in form.
  col
    link "Sticky footer" /docs/5.3/examples/sticky-footer/
    text Attach a footer to the bottom of the viewport when page content is short.
  col
    link "Sticky footer navbar" /docs/5.3/examples/sticky-footer-navbar/
    text Attach a footer to the bottom of the viewport with a fixed top navbar.
  col
    link Jumbotron /docs/5.3/examples/jumbotron/
    text Use utilities to recreate and enhance Bootstrap 4's jumbotron.
h2 Framework
text Examples that focus on implementing uses of built-in components provided by Bootstrap.
