h2 Navbars
text Taking the default navbar component and showing how it can be moved, placed, and extended.
row
  col
    link Navbars /docs/5.3/examples/navbars/
    text Demonstration of all responsive and container options for the navbar.
  col
    link "Navbars offcanvas" /docs/5.3/examples/navbars-offcanvas/
    text Same as the Navbars example, but with our offcanvas component.
  col
    link "Navbar static" /docs/5.3/examples/navbar-static/
    text Single navbar example of a static top navbar along with some additional content.
  col
    link "Navbar fixed" /docs/5.3/examples/navbar-fixed/
    text Single navbar example with a fixed top navbar along with some additional content.
  col
    link "Navbar bottom" /docs/5.3/examples/navbar-bottom/
    text Single navbar example with a bottom navbar along with some additional content.
  col
    link "Offcanvas navbar" /docs/5.3/examples/offcanvas-navbar/
    text Turn your expandable navbar into a sliding offcanvas menu (doesn't use our offcanvas component).
